20 AI Study Planner

## Overview

Develop an AI-powered study planning system that creates personalized study schedules based on subjects, deadlines, available time, and student performance.

## Core Features

* Subject management
* Exam/deadline management
* Available study time
* Study schedule generation
* Task tracking
* Progress monitoring
* Performance tracking

## Possible Extensions

* Adaptive scheduling
* Performance prediction
* Personalized learning recommendations
* Difficulty estimation
* AI study assistant
* Automatic schedule adjustment

## Suggested Difficulty

Advanced
